# insta's pending-snapshot scratch files. A run with a failing snapshot test
# writes `.<file>.pending-snap` next to the source, and `cargo insta accept`
# removes it — but an interrupted or merely-observed failure leaves one behind,
# untracked and easy to `git add -A`. 071f158c4 committed one; #1900 had to
# delete it again.
*.pending-snap
